<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-BORDER 103-4 AT LUNCH, AGAINST GRIQUAS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-BORDER 103-4 AT LUNCH, AGAINST GRIQUAS.</headline>
<dateline>EAST LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Border, having won the toss and elected to bat first, were 103 for four at lunch on the opening day of their Supersport series cricket match against Griqualand West on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Border 103-4 (Garth Roe 3-28).</p>
</text>
